 bacteria. ... Formula g/L\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDifco™ Soytone 10 kg | Contact Us | Gibco™ | thermofisher.com (https://www.thermofisher.com/order/catalog/product/jp/en/212489)\nciteturn33search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week;   * Image: Difco&trade; Soytone\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n90: MALT EXTRACT PEPTONE AGAR | Media | MediaDive (https://bacmedia.dsmz.de/medium/90?ccno=DSM+28657&mobile=1)\nciteturn33search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; MALT EXTRACT PEPTONE AGAR\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMalt Extract Agar Base, Modified as per Thom and Church (https://www.himedialabs.com/us/fields-of-application/clinical/non-selective-media-for-fungi-yeasts-and-molds/m995-malt-extract-agar-base-modified-as-per-thom-and-church.html)\nciteturn33search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; Peptone  | 0.780 ... Following the formula of Reddish, Thom and Church (3) used Malt extract as a base from which they prepared the complete media. ... Reddish, 1919, Abst. ... Product Name  | Malt Extract Agar Base, Modified as per Thom and Church\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMalt Extract Desiccated Analysis Report | PDF | Mycology (https://www.scribd.com/document/813190734/4373935-02)\nciteturn33search9 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4.0 years ago; Crawled: 1.8 years ago; ## Tested in Malt Extract Agar CM0059 ... OXOID LIMITED\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n牛肉エキス・Bacteriological meat extract・559-35935〖詳細情報〗｜〖分析〗〖ライフサイエンス〗｜試薬-富士フイルム和光純薬 (https://labchem-wako.fujifilm.com/jp/product/detail/W01BIKA1710.html)\nciteturn33search10 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; \n\n## 関連製品\n\n### 製品ラインアップ\n\n  * Solabia Biokar Diagnostics\n\n  * ペプトン/タンパク質加水分解物、寒天\n\n### 製品一覧\n\n製品名\n---\nニュートリエントブロス  | \n2% ニュートリエン