格・包装規格の改訂が行われた場合、画像と実際の製品の仕様が異なる場合があります。\n  * 掲載されている製品について\n\n〖試薬〗\n    試験・研究の目的のみに使用されるものであり、「医薬品」、「食品」、「家庭用品」などとしては使用できません。\n    試験研究用以外にご使用された場合、いかなる保証も致しかねます。試験研究用以外の用途や原料にご使用希望の場合、弊社営業部門にお問合せください。\n〖医薬品原料〗\n    製造専用医薬品及び医薬品添加物などを医薬品等の製造原料として製造業者向けに販売しています。製造専用医薬品(製品名に製造専用の表示があるもの)のご購入には、確認書が必要です。\n  * 表示している希望納入価格は「本体価格のみ」で消費税等は含まれておりません。\n  * 表示している希望納入価格は本記事掲載時点の価格です。--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMuscat Municipality (https://www.mm.gov.om/QuotationDetails.aspx?QN=2382022)\nciteturn33search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3.6 years ago; Crawled: last month;        Baird Parker Medium - OXOID/UK - 2bottle cm0275 500g ...        Malt Extract Agar- CM0059B 500g\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMalt extract agar (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malt_extract_agar)\nciteturn33search18 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 5 months ago; Other ingredients such as peptone, dextrose or yeast extract may also be included. ... *  https://ezmushroom.com/grow/light-malt-extract-lme-agar-recipe/\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMalzextrakt-Agar (https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malzextrakt-Agar)\nciteturn33search19 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 1.8 years ago; * M94 Malt Extract Broth (Fertigmedium von Difco: Malzextrakt 6 g/L, Maltose 1,8 g/L, Dextrose 6 g/L, Hefeextrakt 1,2 g/L) & Agar 15 g/L\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAgar - Do I need to add suger or something to all generic agar mixes? (https://www.reddit.com/r/shrooms/comments/vmojwf)\nciteturn33reddit20 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4.4 years ago; FORMULA: 35.7% Malt Extract 1.8% Pancreatic Digest of Gelatin (Peptone G) 35.7% Dextrose 26.8% Agar Agar SOLUTION INSTRUCTIONS: Step 1: Dissolve 100g of Malt Extract Agar (MEA) in 1.8 Liters of Distilled Water Step 2: Bring to a Boil and Stir Step 3: Autoclave at 121 degrees Celsius for 15 minutes Step 4: Pour into Petri Dishes\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nYM (selective medium) (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YM_%28selective_medium%29)\nciteturn33search21 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2.1 years ago; It is malt extract medium modified by the addition of yeast extract and peptone. ... *  \"Yeast and Malt Extract with Glucose Agar Recipe\".\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGélose à l'extrait de malt (https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/G%C3%A9lose_%C3%A0_l%27extrait_de_malt)\nciteturn33search22 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 1.5 years ago; Elle est aussi appelée \"GEM\" (pour Gélose à l'Extrait de Malt) ou \"MEA\" (de l'anglais Malt Extract Agar).. ... Reddish en 1919, puis Fullmer et Grimes utilisèrent l'extrait de malt pour la culture des levures en milieu synthétique. ... Certains fabricants ajoutent 5,0 grammes de peptone mycologique.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLow ph agar medium (https://www.reddit.com/r/microbiology/comments/1dcqp8e)\nciteturn33reddit23 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2.4 years ago; Crawled: 2.4 years ago;   Ypd (yeast extract, peptone, dextrose). ... When we want to drop the pH of Malt Extract Agar (MEA) we add 10% lactic acid (filter sterilised). ... I've made media at pH between 2.9-4 .\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPotato dextrose agar (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Potato_dextrose_agar)\nciteturn33search24 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; These agars include but are not limited to malt extract agar and sabouraud agar. Malt extract agar is more acidic than PDA and is commonly used to cultivate penicillium species. ... *  Pitt & Hocking (2009).\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAgar plate (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agar_plate)\nciteturn33search25 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; Like other growth media, the formulations of agar used in plates may be classified as either \"defined\" or \"undefined\"; a defined medium is synthesized from individual chemicals required by the organism so the exact molecular composition is known, whereas an undefined medium is made from natural products such as yeast extract, where the precise composition is unknown. ... BAPs are enriched, and differential media is used to isolate fastidious organisms and detect hemolytic activity. β-Hemolytic activity will show lysis and complete digestion of red blood cell contents surrounding a colony. ... BAPs also contain meat extract or yeast extract, tryptone, sodium chloride, and agar. ... * Sabouraud agar is used to culture fungi and has a low pH that inhibits the growth of most bacteria; it also contains the antibiotic gentamicin to specifically inhibit the growth of Gram-negative bacteria. ... The mega plate also helped study more unique concepts of microbiology such as parallel evolution, mutation selection, colonial interference etc. ... *  \"Blood Agar- Composition, Preparation, Uses and Pictures\", Microbiology Info.com\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn33view0 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium310a.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); \nFailed to fetch https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium310a.pdf: (404) Not Found--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://labchem-wako.fujifilm.com/us/catalog/pdf/catalog_0005.pdf)\nciteturn33view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 40; Source: find({\"ref_id\":\"turn30view0\",\"pattern\":\"HIPOLYPEPTON\"}); Total lines: 3362\nL307@P7: Product Name Storage Purpose Pkg.Size Wako Cat.No.\nL308@P7: Potassium Tellurite Solution 1% ''DAIGO'' RT For adding to Vogel-Johnson Agar and Baird-P